cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Opentrons Flex Protocols for 384-Well Sample Preparation for
  Nontargeted Exposomics
message: >-
  If you use these protocols, please cite the associated paper (see
  preferred-citation below). To reference a specific version of the code,
  please also cite the archived software release.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Opentrons Flex Protocol API v2 protocols and custom labware definitions for
  automated sample preparation of biosamples performed in the 384-well format. 
  A single 30 uL extraction yields aliquots for complementary chromatographic platforms 
  in positive and negative electrospray ionization mode, giving multiple nontargeted LC-HRMS 
  assays from one preparation of up to 288 study samples plus QA/QC materials per plate.
